<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1716" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀέρ-ῐνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>aerial, like air</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1049a26
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>de An.</u>
				435a12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>light blue</i> (or <i>grey</i>), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στολή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Es.</u>
					8.15
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσθής</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					4.119
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολλύριον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					12.780
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of the planet
			Jupiter, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ λεγόμενος Ζεὺς ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ps.-Callisth.
					1.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
